OL,3,APolls close in Brazilian election
OL,4,Arun-off between Lula and Bolsonaro
OL,5,Aafter last-minute extension
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva
OL,8,Fclaimed public transport had been
OL,9,Fdisrupted in some cities, while his
OL,10,Fopponent Flavio Bolsonaro's campaign
OL,11,Fclaimed bad weather affected voters in
OL,12,Fa number of locations
OL,14,FVoting was extended until 19:00 local
OL,15,Ftime nationwide, but Supreme Court
OL,16,Fminister Cristiano Zanin said this only
OL,17,Fapplied at polls where voting had not
OL,18,Fyet been finalised
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
