OL,3,APolls close in Brazilian election
OL,4,Arun-off between Lula and Bolsonaro
OL,5,Aafter last-minute extension
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the second round of voting after
OL,8,Fright-wing senator Bolsonaro won the
OL,9,Ffirst round earlier this month -
OL,10,Fbeating incumbent President Lula, but
OL,11,Ffalling short of an outright majority.
OL,12,FHere's what you need to know
